## Request

Build the smallest complete change-only trend and export slice on the existing hosted dashboard.
Preserve measurement boundaries, distinguish missing coverage from no change, and export only the
same allowlisted filtered projection shown to the operator.

## Contract Decisions

- Work Efficiency history stores accepted semantic changes rather than every heartbeat.
- Retention is explicitly capped; window options are controlled and server-rendered.
- Each trend row exposes freshness, sample count/window, platform/version, token coverage, and
  counter epoch or reset qualification where reported.
- Different coverage, epoch, platform, or version states are not silently compared or ranked.
- CSV and JSON use one versioned projection, active filters, generated-at time, and a strict row cap.

